<td>Seed de recursos, papéis e grants (<code>member</code>, <code>super_admin</code>, <code>events_admin</code>)</td>
<td>Executado</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Perfil administrador (<code>04b919ba-38b4-4fe5-a371-2e98e9acbc0d</code>) com <code>super_admin</code> + <code>member</code></td>
<td>Configurado</td>
</tr>
